==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} ''[[excrescens|excrēscēns]]'', present participle of ''[[excresco|excrēscō]]''.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something growing, usually abnormally, out of something else.
# {{context|phonetics}} A sound in a word without [[etymological]] reason.
#: ''"B" in "nimble" is an '''excrescent'''.''

